.TITLE "groups"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Displays the group memberships for a user. It lists the names of __groups__ to which the current or specified user belongs.

.DIV "ALIAS"

.DIV "TLDR"
**groups**
Lists the groups for the current user.
> 

**groups user**
Lists the groups for a specific username.
> __user__ target username

.DIV "SUMMARY"
In macOS, group memberships are managed through the Open Directory system. The __groups__ command provides a quick way to verify permissions and access levels associated with group identities.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**mac:whoami** **mac:id**

documentation: __https://ss64.com/osx/groups.html__
